1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:05,856
Myth or fact? If we only sell to consumers, e-invoicing doesn't apply to us.

2
00:00:05,976 --> 00:00:09,727
We only sell to consumers. E-invoicing isn't for us, right?

3
00:00:09,847 --> 00:00:11,522
For now, that's right.

4
00:00:11,642 --> 00:00:13,165
So we can forget it?

5
00:00:13,285 --> 00:00:15,911
Not if you add business customers.

6
00:00:16,031 --> 00:00:17,446
Fact, for now.

7
00:00:17,566 --> 00:00:25,743
MD 244 of 2025 keeps consumer-only businesses outside, until a later decision.

8
00:00:25,863 --> 00:00:29,308
Our readiness work starts with your scope.

9
00:00:29,428 --> 00:00:34,322
Not sure? Message us.
